      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i've done it before and it's fine, i don't really get heart palpitations or anything. i just feel like i need to push through this week. if i just take a normal amount of caffeine, like one coffee or a small energy drink, is that really gonna do anything bad? i just want to know if it's actually dangerous or if people just say that to be safe.",
